        "title": "Counters Lock Cancels",
        "text": "When a counter move catches your attack, you're normally locked out of canceling the move it caught - you just have to eat the counterattack. But a few characters have an Instant Charge exception that can still bail them out before it lands."
      },
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "title": "The Exception",
        "text": "Misaki {input:22A} answers with a BLOCKABLE counterattack. In this matchup, Shiori can Red IC the moment she triggers the counter, then block the answer. Fair warning: this escape belongs to Shiori - don't assume your character gets it too."
      }
    ],
